# Line endings: LF everywhere, in the index AND in the working tree.
#
# Why this file exists: core.autocrlf is true at SYSTEM level on the authoring
# machine. Without this, a fresh clone checks out CRLF while the local source
# mirror (Local_Prep_Source\, which lives outside this repo) stays LF, so the
# two trees stop being byte-identical although nobody edited anything. The
# sync tooling compares them byte-for-byte and would then refuse to run.
#
# text=auto still auto-detects binaries; the explicit list below is
# belt-and-braces so an image can never be renormalised.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png  binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
